sequenceDiagram
    actor User
    participant Web as Board and capture queue
    participant API as Existing API
    participant Storage as Private R2
    participant Worker as Media worker

    User->>Web: Capture inputs
    Web->>Web: Snapshot destination and assign item IDs
    alt Image
        Web->>API: Reserve upload
        API-->>Web: Asset ID and signed URL
        Web->>Storage: Upload image
    end
    Web->>API: Create item with stable UUID
    alt Confirmed response
        API-->>Web: Existing or newly created item
        Web-->>User: Saved card
        opt Image or link
            Worker->>Worker: Prepare media or preview
            Web->>API: Poll existing item reads
            API-->>Web: Current processing status
        end
    else Response lost or save failed
        Web-->>User: Retain input and offer Retry
        User->>Web: Retry
        Web->>API: Repeat identical item request
        API-->>Web: Existing or newly created item
    end
